{"1991820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Drunken FC", "steam_appid": 1991820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: you and your buddies are <strong>playing soccer</strong>, but you're all <strong>drunk</strong> as skunks. And not just any old drunk, I'm talking falling-down, can't walk straight, pissing your pants drunk. Sounds like a blast, right? Well, that's exactly what Drunken FC is all about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drunken FC is a physics comedy game with no coordination and no dignity, just bodies and momentum. Every match is ragdoll chaos. There's no story, just straight-up action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four players on one couch, as teammates or enemies, or solo against the CPU if you'd rather embarrass yourself in private. Sixteen characters, four pitches, endless ways to fall over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want a party game that'll have a room cracking up for hours, this is it. Grab a controller. Move your feet. Try not to snap the sticks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players local multiplayer: co-op or versus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player mode against CPU opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 playable characters with costumes, country teams, and national colours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four playable pitches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports controller and keyboard (controller strongly recommended).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/729ba237c68276a8b4e387afd52e00ae.poster.avif?t=1786204198\" width=608 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/729ba237c68276a8b4e387afd52e00ae.webm?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/729ba237c68276a8b4e387afd52e00ae.mp4?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fantastic jumps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/18b2b2c2f7b2614ba40bf95860567c83.poster.avif?t=1786204198\" width=640 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/18b2b2c2f7b2614ba40bf95860567c83.webm?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/18b2b2c2f7b2614ba40bf95860567c83.mp4?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic takedowns!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/599f357cf56c82556b5101953f528844.poster.avif?t=1786204198\" width=640 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/599f357cf56c82556b5101953f528844.webm?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/599f357cf56c82556b5101953f528844.mp4?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Picture this: you and your buddies are <strong>playing soccer</strong>, but you're all <strong>drunk</strong> as skunks. And not just any old drunk, I'm talking falling-down, can't walk straight, pissing your pants drunk. Sounds like a blast, right? Well, that's exactly what Drunken FC is all about.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drunken FC is a physics comedy game with no coordination and no dignity, just bodies and momentum. Every match is ragdoll chaos. There's no story, just straight-up action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with up to four players on one couch, as teammates or enemies, or solo against the CPU if you'd rather embarrass yourself in private. Sixteen characters, four pitches, endless ways to fall over. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want a party game that'll have a room cracking up for hours, this is it. Grab a controller. Move your feet. Try not to snap the sticks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Up to four players local multiplayer: co-op or versus.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player mode against CPU opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 playable characters with costumes, country teams, and national colours.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four playable pitches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports controller and keyboard (controller strongly recommended).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/729ba237c68276a8b4e387afd52e00ae.poster.avif?t=1786204198\" width=608 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/729ba237c68276a8b4e387afd52e00ae.webm?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/729ba237c68276a8b4e387afd52e00ae.mp4?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fantastic jumps!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/18b2b2c2f7b2614ba40bf95860567c83.poster.avif?t=1786204198\" width=640 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/18b2b2c2f7b2614ba40bf95860567c83.webm?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/18b2b2c2f7b2614ba40bf95860567c83.mp4?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Epic takedowns!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/599f357cf56c82556b5101953f528844.poster.avif?t=1786204198\" width=640 height=506 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/599f357cf56c82556b5101953f528844.webm?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1991820/extras/599f357cf56c82556b5101953f528844.mp4?t=1786204198\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "It's football, but everyone on the pitch is drunk. Drunken FC is a physics comedy game with no coordination and no dignity, just bodies and momentum. Up to four players on one couch, as teammates or enemies. Grab a controller. Move your feet. Try not to snap the sticks.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Hungarian, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese", "reviews"